# How do I provision a minimal Acme Corporation for development?
# Provision the Acme Corporation tenant with only its group entity, books and the ORE sample counterparties, for a fast import and export loop.
#
# GENERATED from doc/recipes/shell/provisioning/how_do_i_provision_a_minimal_acme_corporation_for_development.org — do not edit by hand.
# Regenerate with: ./compass.sh build --direct tangle_shell_scripts
